WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
<v RAY>Think about a normal shift, where blades
get changed all morning.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.320
<v DANA>So where does each of those blades end
up?

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:11.310
<v RAY>Almost every one goes to the container.
Someone walks it down and walks back, and

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:13.680
<v RAY>then someone else does the same thing.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.080
<v DANA>And nobody says anything about it?

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:20.240
<v RAY>[warmly] No, not a word. Walking it down
is just part of the job.

